    "description": "KDRIVE-004 (kDrive): two siblings equal after normalization caused an infinite sync loop. Rules P2, P1 and D4: the one committed first comes down, the other is listed (name-collision) and stays on the drive; nothing is overwritten or trashed, and the next passes change nothing. sync-chaos port-nfc-nfd, port-linux-nfd-distinct.",
